&lt;li&gt;Work closely with hardware and software teams to translate high level module product requirements and architecture specifications into a detailed engineering execution plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage in problem-solving to resolve design and manufacturing challenges for innovative high-performance laser solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively collaborate across disciplines—with electronics, photonics, mechanical, thermal and package-design engineering teams—to build photonic systems, control algorithms, PICs, and control ASICs that meet performance, power, and production requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with control-system and test engineers to define production test and validation protocols, as well as to characterize components and debug test results from prototype level to validation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with external vendors to ensure timely development and delivery of key processes and components&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
