&lt;li&gt;Work with manufacturing teams/partners to increase yields, test coverage, capacity, and reduce production costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner and drive all wafer and package level manufacturing activities by working closely with foundry and assembly houses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead test time reduction for ramping to HVM.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in a fast paced and dynamic environment and be passionate about delivering quality work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write and maintain scripts/tools for the test engineering group, enhancing the group’s overall productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
