&lt;li&gt;8+ years of ATE Test Development Experience using Advantest V93000 or Teradyne.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in scripting languages like Python or Java.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience maintaining and releasing ATE test programs to OSAT.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in data analysis techniques and tools, such as excel, JMP, etc&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and teamwork abilities&lt;/li&gt;
