&lt;li&gt;Architect test concepts, test platforms, design for test rules, and provide feedback early on during the technology concept phase.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create detailed test plan documentation and ensure timely execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define, develop, and setup of wafer, package and system level tests for Lightmatter silicon photonics products.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop test software to enable test execution, data analysis, and parameter extraction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with vendors to specify and procure test equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Setup and operate a range of optical equipment such as tunable lasers, power meters, polarization synthesizer, OBR/OVA, and high-speed test equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage with silicon and platform validation teams and bridge any gaps between test and validation teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with OSAT teams to define, validate, and refine test techniques for high volume manufacturing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the reliability team for pre and post-stress test needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep up to date with the latest developments in Silicon Photonics technology and testability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master’s in Photonics, Physics, Electrical Engineering or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A minimum of 8+ years of proven experience in silicon photonics test development&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven industrial experience in supporting new product introduction and volume production&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of Silicon Photonics components and circuits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with design teams to define test cells for model feedback and validation&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands on experience in characterization and test of photonics components and circuits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of direct experience in high-speed photonic device test, system link bring-up, and familiar with test equipment such as AWG, DCA, DSO, PNA, LCA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in test system automation using Python&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills to identify and solve issues during the testing process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to convey complex technical concepts to both technical and non-technical stakeholders&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
